<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas says foreigners sell down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas says foreigners sell down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Friday that recent foreign sales have resulted in foreign shareholders having a relevant interest in about 47.89 percent of its shares, compared with the government limit of 49 percent.</p>
<p>Qantas said foreign shareholders previously held about 50.29 percent of the airline's issued capital.</p>
<p>Qantas is 25 percent owned by British Airways Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
